  "intro": "Four straight seasons, four straight champions, and the league opens 2026 with the reigning king walking straight into the guy who's spent two years wearing the #1 seed like a curse. Adam Stockwell, fresh off finally exorcising that demon, goes on the road to Logan Rezac's place as a projected underdog \u2014 which feels about right for a rivalry built on Logan's misery. Elsewhere, Noah Thesing starts his title defense against the actual John Lundquist, a man who's beaten his own brother in six of nine meetings and would love nothing more than to make the defending champ's summer as short as Peter's was in 2023."
}